{"id":"a48988fed4470569","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-fixed-truth-values.md","title":"Definition — j-固定真值对象","display":"Definition — j-固定真值对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-fixed-truth-values","aliases":["14-df-fixed-truth-values"],"display":"Definition — j-固定真值对象","depends_on":["[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-fixed-truth-values"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-fixed-truth-values</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — j-固定真值对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a> 的满子范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 为 LT 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega\">\\(e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_\\Omega\">\\(1_\\Omega\\)</span> 的等化子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega,\\qquad j\\circ e_j=e_j,\\qquad\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega)\\ (j\\circ p=p\\Rightarrow\\exists!q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega_j)\\ e_j\\circ q=p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega,\\qquad j\\circ e_j=e_j,\\qquad\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega)\\ (j\\circ p=p\\Rightarrow\\exists!q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega_j)\\ e_j\\circ q=p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top_j:=\\iota q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega_j)\\ (e_j\\circ q=\\top),\\qquad e_j\\circ\\top_j=\\top.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top_j:=\\iota q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega_j)\\ (e_j\\circ q=\\top),\\qquad e_j\\circ\\top_j=\\top.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.2–3。等化子存在因为有限极限，j∘⊤=⊤ 给出唯一 top_j；本项不预先假定其已为层范畴分类子。与现有<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a>的同名满子范畴约定相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]] 的满子范畴；$j$ 为 LT 拓扑；$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$ 见 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]；$e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega$ 取 $j$ 与 $1_\\Omega$ 的等化子。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]] 的满子范畴；$j$ 为 LT 拓扑；$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$ 见 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]；$e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega$ 取 $j$ 与 $1_\\Omega$ 的等化子。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 V.2–3。等化子存在因为有限极限，j∘⊤=⊤ 给出唯一 top_j；本项不预先假定其已为层范畴分类子。与现有[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]的同名满子范畴约定相容。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"1_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"e_j:\\Omega_j\\to\\Omega,\\qquad j\\circ e_j=e_j,\\qquad\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega)\\ (j\\circ p=p\\Rightarrow\\exists!q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega_j)\\ e_j\\circ q=p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top_j:=\\iota q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega_j)\\ (e_j\\circ q=\\top),\\qquad e_j\\circ\\top_j=\\top.","display":true}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-fixed-truth-values|Definition — j-固定真值对象]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-fixed-truth-values]]"},{"id":"fb9c7afb199c12e2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j$ 为 LT 拓扑，$A$ 为对象。$e_j:\\Omega_j\\hookrightarrow\\Omega$ 为 [[14-df-fixed-truth-values]] 的等化子；$\\delta_A:A\\times A\\to\\Omega$ 为 [[14-thm-separated-diagonal]] 的对角特征箭头。指数转置使用 [[14-df-exponentials]] 的 $\\Lambda_{A;A,\\Omega_j}$。以下先定义 $c_A,\\kappa_A,W_A$ 及像类；然后为每个 $A$ 选取该像的正则满/单代表 $(S_j(A),q_A,m_A)$。选择是在 $\\mathcal V$ 内进行，不要求不同像的对象代表字面相同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-fixed-truth-values]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-fixed-truth-values|Definition — j-固定真值对象]]"},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j$ 为 LT 拓扑；$\\Omega_j,e_j,\\top_j,\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 的精确定义见 [[14-df-fixed-truth-values]]。"},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9135c45b14ec366c","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","389620cd4ca5e1c6","55bd5d1a324171ab"]}